*  m1_beauty_arbno_defer_min.sno — THE BEAUTY SELF-HOST BLOCKER, ablated to its ingredients (s137).
*
*  Provenance: beauty.sno stops after 7 correct lines and prints its own 'Parse Error' from
*
*        Src   POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0)          :F(mainErr1)      (beauty.sno:611/615)
*
*  parsing the single bare line "START".  Parse is (beauty.sno:225)
*
*        Parse = nPush() ARBNO(*Command) ("'Parse'" & 'nTop()') nPop()
*
*  i.e. an ARBNO whose BODY IS A DEFERRED PATTERN REFERENCE, reached through a DEFER, with
*  function calls in pattern position on both sides.  This file keeps exactly those ingredients and
*  nothing else: no include files, no tables, no pp().  SPITBOL is the oracle (.ref beside it).
         &ANCHOR      =  1
         Word         =  SPAN('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
         Space        =  SPAN(' ') | LEN(0)
*  Command is the recursive body: one word, optionally followed by more.
         Command      =  Word *Space
*  Parse mirrors beauty's shape: ARBNO over a DEFERRED body, wrapped by defers on both sides.
         Parse        =  ARBNO(*Command)
*  A: the bare-label line that beauty was parsing when it failed.
         Src          =  'START'
         Src          POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0)                :F(FA)
         OUTPUT       =  'A ok'                                   :(B)
FA       OUTPUT       =  'A FAIL'
*  B: two words — forces ARBNO to take a SECOND iteration through the defer.
B        Src          =  'START HERE'
         Src          POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0)                :F(FB)
         OUTPUT       =  'B ok'                                   :(C)
FB       OUTPUT       =  'B FAIL'
*  C: three words — third iteration; a per-iteration slot that is overwritten shows up here.
C        Src          =  'ONE TWO THREE'
         Src          POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0)                :F(FC)
         OUTPUT       =  'C ok'                                   :(D)
FC       OUTPUT       =  'C FAIL'
*  D: zero words — ARBNO must match the null string and RPOS(0) must still close.
D        Src          =
         Src          POS(0) *Parse *Space RPOS(0)                :F(FD)
         OUTPUT       =  'D ok'                                   :(END)
FD       OUTPUT       =  'D FAIL'
END
